      "entries": [
        "The stoneliege turns their own body into solid stone like a statue and immediately becomes petrified (Core Rulebook 621). Any creature grappled or restrained by the stoneliege becomes immobilized; to get free, the creature must damage the statue enough to break it or succeed at a DC 28 Acrobatics check to Escape."
